  {
   "id": "hidden-cats-in-new-york-237236@major-2023-01-05",
   "gameId": "hidden-cats-in-new-york-237236",
   "displayName": "Hidden Cats in New York + Paris Update",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-01-05T15:29:49.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Our release of Hidden Cats in London was awesome. Thanks to you all, we had a lot of feedback that allowed us to polish the game and get new ideas for new Hidden Objects projects.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Hidden Cats in London",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Small updates are on the way to polish a few things.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Hidden Cats in New York",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Our next Hidden Cats game is under production with even more contents. Expect it this Q1 of 2023. Add it to your wishlist and follow us to be aware of news.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Hidden Cats in Paris",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Many people asked for more, and we are working to put Paris on the same level as London in terms of content and price. More information we'll be given on the game page as soon as we have more to share. You can expect the update release on this Q1 of 2023.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Those are just the first news that we can share with you, but more Hidden Cats games will come this year! We wish you all an amazing 2023!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
